SUMMARY:Business Plan 101 | Nov 24
DESCRIPTION:Why have a business plan? A business plan is a roadmap for your business that outlines goals and details how you plan to achieve those goals. \nTHIS SESSION WILL EXPLORE: \n\nBusiness Plan overview & why it’s vital\nThought mapping your business\nResearch /information you’ll need\nUnderstanding your target market\nBusiness Model Canvas: 1 page plan\nDeveloping a plan for success\nIntroduction to Financial Planning and Forecasting\n\nUpon completion of the webinar\, you will receive additional resources and templates and will be fully equipped to start drafting your own business plan. \nClick here to access the Zoom call (Please ensure you are registered so you can receive any post-session resources).
URL:https://www.waterlooregionsmallbusiness.com/event/business-plan-101-nov-24/
LOCATION:https://kitchener-ca.zoom.us/j/82487713938
CATEGORIES:Growing your Business,Starting a Business
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.waterlooregionsmallbusiness.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/8c7a633dac558e88eeedf2470e9ab6b7-HmnSzz.tmp_.jpg
END:VEVENT
