UID:10001609-1795611600-1795617000@www.waterlooregionsmallbusiness.com
SUMMARY:Demystifying Succession Planning
DESCRIPTION:Free Drop-In Workshop & One-on-One Consulting with George Boahene \n\nDate: November 25\nTime: 1:00 PM – 2:30 PM\nLocation: SDG Idea Factory\nCost: Free \nThinking about selling your business\, passing it on to family or employees\, or planning your retirement? Join us for an informal drop-in session with Business Advisor George Boahene to learn the basics of succession planning and explore your options for the future of your business. \nThis session will begin with a short presentation\, Demystifying Succession Planning\, followed by opportunities for one-on-one discussions and personalized guidance. Whether you’re just starting to think about transitioning your business or are ready to develop a plan\, George can help answer your questions and connect you with free resources available through Succession Ontario. \nWhat you’ll learn: \n\nThe fundamentals of succession and exit planning\nCommon transition options for business owners\nHow to start planning for a successful business transition\nResources and supports available through Succession Ontario\n\nDrop in\, ask questions\, and take the first step toward securing the future of your business. \nRegistration required. Learn more about Succession Ontario and the supports available to Ontario business owners.
URL:https://www.waterlooregionsmallbusiness.com/event/succession-planning-nov2026/
LOCATION:SDG Idea Factory\, 2 King Street West\, #Suite 100\, Kitchener\, ON\, N2G 1A3\, Canada
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.waterlooregionsmallbusiness.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Succession.jpg
END:VEVENT
